{"seq":11,"ts":1780168232940,"type":"assistant_delta","text":"**superpowers-lite** is active alongside **delegate**. Here's the combined workflow at a glance:\n\n| Phase | Action |\n|-------|--------|\n| **Understand** | Clarify goal, affected area, risks |\n| **Explore** | Search/read files, use parallel explorers for multi-file work |\n| **Plan** | Short plan: files, purpose, verification, rollback |\n| **Implement** | Narrow edits — patch/`edit_file` over full rewrites. Local-first via Ollama where suitable |\n| **Review** | Local review pass; fix critical findings |\n| **Verify** | Targeted tests, lint, manual checks |\n| **Commit** | `git add -A && git commit && git push` |\n| **Report** | What changed, files touched, verification, commit status |\n\nDelegation fits into **Explore** (parallel read-only sub-agents) and **Implement** (bounded file-ownership sub-agents). Parent keeps architecture, integration, and final verification.\n\nWhat's the task?","final":true}
